| CUDA Concept | RAJA Abstraction | How it Changes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `__global__ void kernel(...)` | `raja::parallel_for(range, policy(), lambda)` | The kernel function is replaced by a loop structure where the body is a lambda function. |
| `blockIdx.x`, `threadIdx.x` | Loop variables (`i`, `row_idx`, `col_idx`) | RAJA automatically maps the loop iteration variable to the correct hardware thread/block index based on the chosen `policy`. |
